<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 625.61, up 3.04.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.07.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 303 to 258.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,745,765 compared with 26,208,730 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
